{"id":116011,"date":"2026-01-21T09:01:29","date_gmt":"2026-01-21T02:01:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/?p=116011"},"modified":"2026-05-22T14:43:06","modified_gmt":"2026-05-22T07:43:06","slug":"cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/","title":{"rendered":"Descubra as 10 cidades tur\u00edsticas mais famosas da Tail\u00e2ndia"},"content":{"rendered":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A Tail\u00e2ndia \u00e9 um dos destinos mais fascinantes do Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico, conhecida por sua cultura rica, templos deslumbrantes e paisagens naturais incr\u00edveis. Explorar <\/span><\/i><b><i>as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia<\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> permite descobrir desde metr\u00f3poles vibrantes at\u00e9 destinos tranquilos cercados pela natureza. Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 planejando sua viagem, conhecer as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia mais famosas vai ajudar a criar um roteiro completo e inesquec\u00edvel.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_83 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\">\n<p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Table of Contents<\/p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Table of Content\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle<\/span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"><\/path><\/svg><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" class=\"arrow-unsorted-368013\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"10px\" height=\"10px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.2\" baseProfile=\"tiny\"><path d=\"M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"\/><\/svg><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/div>\n<nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#1_Bangkok_%E2%80%93_capital_da_Terra_dos_Templos_Dourados\" >1. Bangkok \u2013 capital da Terra dos Templos Dourados<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#2_Pattaya_%E2%80%93_cidade_vibrante_e_animada\" >2. Pattaya \u2013 cidade vibrante e animada<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#3_Phuket_%E2%80%93_a_maior_ilha_da_Tailandia\" >3. Phuket \u2013 a maior ilha da Tail\u00e2ndia<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#4_Chiang_Mai_%E2%80%93_a_rosa_do_norte_da_Terra_dos_Templos_Dourados\" >4. Chiang Mai \u2013 a rosa do norte da Terra dos Templos Dourados<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#5_Krabi_%E2%80%93_um_dos_arquipelagos_mais_encantadores_do_mundo\" >5. Krabi \u2013 um dos arquip\u00e9lagos mais encantadores do mundo<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#6_Chiang_Rai_%E2%80%93_famosa_por_seus_templos_deslumbrantes\" >6. Chiang Rai \u2013 famosa por seus templos deslumbrantes<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#7_Hua_Hin_%E2%80%93_uma_cidade_litoranea_promissora\" >7. Hua Hin \u2013 uma cidade litor\u00e2nea promissora<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#8_Ayutthaya_%E2%80%93_cidade_historica_da_Tailandia\" >8. Ayutthaya \u2013 cidade hist\u00f3rica da Tail\u00e2ndia<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#9_Nakhon_Ratchasima_%E2%80%93_cidade_turistica_do_centro_da_Tailandia\" >9. Nakhon Ratchasima \u2013 cidade tur\u00edstica do centro da Tail\u00e2ndia<\/a><\/li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/cidades-turisticas-famosas-da-tailandia\/#10_Kanchanaburi_%E2%80%93_cidade_de_ecoturismo_na_Tailandia\" >10. Kanchanaburi \u2013 cidade de ecoturismo na Tail\u00e2ndia<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/nav><\/div>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"1_Bangkok_%E2%80%93_capital_da_Terra_dos_Templos_Dourados\"><\/span>1. Bangkok \u2013 capital da Terra dos Templos Dourados<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/bangkok-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bangkok<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e9 uma metr\u00f3pole vibrante que combina tradi\u00e7\u00e3o e modernidade, com templos magn\u00edficos, mercados animados, vida noturna intensa e uma culin\u00e1ria de rua famosa mundialmente.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/grande-palacio\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Grande Pal\u00e1cio<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/wat-phra-kaew-bangkok\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Phra Kaew (Templo do Buda de Esmeralda)<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/web-stories\/wat-arun-bangkok\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Arun (Templo do Amanhecer)<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/wat-pho\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Pho (Buda Reclinado)<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/mercado-de-chatuchak\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mercado Chatuchak<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khao San Road<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/chinatown-bangkok\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chinatown (Yaowarat)<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 4 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional Suvarnabhumi (BKK)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Don Mueang (DMK)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sukhumvit (moderno, conveniente para transporte)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Silom (centro financeiro com vida noturna)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khao San Road (ideal para mochileros)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Riverside (vista do rio Chao Phraya, mais tranquilo e sofisticado)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116012\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116012\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116012\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Cidade-vibrante-de-templos-mercados-e-modernidade.jpg\" alt=\"Cidade vibrante de templos mercados e modernidade\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Cidade-vibrante-de-templos-mercados-e-modernidade.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Cidade-vibrante-de-templos-mercados-e-modernidade-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Cidade-vibrante-de-templos-mercados-e-modernidade-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Cidade-vibrante-de-templos-mercados-e-modernidade-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116012\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Uma cidade vibrante onde templos sagrados, mercados animados e arranha-c\u00e9us modernos coexistem em perfeita harmonia<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"2_Pattaya_%E2%80%93_cidade_vibrante_e_animada\"><\/span>2. Pattaya \u2013 cidade vibrante e animada<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/pattaya\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pattaya<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e9 conhecida por sua vida noturna agitada, praias acess\u00edveis e diversas atividades de entretenimento, sendo um destino ideal para quem busca divers\u00e3o, esportes aqu\u00e1ticos e experi\u00eancias variadas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pattaya Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Walking Street<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sanctuary of Truth (Santu\u00e1rio da Verdade) <\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nong Nooch Tropical Garden (Jardim Tropical Nong Nooch)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Koh Larn (Ilha Coral)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Floating Market (Mercado Flutuante de Pattaya)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 3 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional U-Tapao (UTP)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Suvarnabhumi (BKK) \u2013 cerca de 1,5 a 2 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pattaya Central (pr\u00f3ximo \u00e0 vida noturna)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pattaya Sul (perto da Walking Street)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jomtien Beach (mais tranquilo e relaxante)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116013\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116013\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116013\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-de-praias-entretenimento-e-vida-noturna-energica.jpg\" alt=\"Destino de praias entretenimento e vida noturna energica\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-de-praias-entretenimento-e-vida-noturna-energica.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-de-praias-entretenimento-e-vida-noturna-energica-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-de-praias-entretenimento-e-vida-noturna-energica-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-de-praias-entretenimento-e-vida-noturna-energica-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116013\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Destino ideal para quem busca praias, entretenimento e uma vida noturna cheia de energia<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"3_Phuket_%E2%80%93_a_maior_ilha_da_Tailandia\"><\/span>3. Phuket \u2013 a maior ilha da Tail\u00e2ndia<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/phuket-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phuket<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e9 famosa por suas praias paradis\u00edacas, \u00e1guas cristalinas e resorts luxuosos, sendo um dos destinos mais populares para relaxamento, vida noturna e atividades mar\u00edtimas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/praia-de-patong\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Patong Beach<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/ilhas-phi-phi-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phi Phi Islands<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Big Buddha Phuket (Grande Buda de Phuket)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/phuket-wat-chalong\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Chalong<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phuket Old Town (Cidade Antiga de Phuket)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kata Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Karon Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3 a 5 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional de Phuket (HKT)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Patong (vida noturna animada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kata e Karon (mais tranquilos e familiares)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phuket Old Town (experi\u00eancia cultural)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116014\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116014\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116014\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes.jpg\" alt=\"Paisagens de fal\u00e9sias e ilhas tropicais deslumbrantes\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116014\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Praias paradis\u00edacas, \u00e1guas cristalinas e um clima tropical perfeito para relaxar e explorar.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"4_Chiang_Mai_%E2%80%93_a_rosa_do_norte_da_Terra_dos_Templos_Dourados\"><\/span>4. Chiang Mai \u2013 a rosa do norte da Terra dos Templos Dourados<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/chiang-mai-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chiang Mai<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> encanta os visitantes com sua atmosfera tranquila, rica heran\u00e7a cultural e natureza exuberante, sendo o lugar ideal para explorar templos antigos, montanhas e tradi\u00e7\u00f5es do norte da Tail\u00e2ndia.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/doi-suthep\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Phra That Doi Suthep<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/wat-chedi-luang\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Chedi Luang<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/wat-phra-singh-chiang-mai\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Phra Singh<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Doi Inthanon National Park (Parque Nacional Doi Inthanon)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elephant Nature Park (Parque Natural dos Elefantes)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chiang Mai Night Bazaar (Mercado Noturno de Chiang Mai)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Old City (Cidade Antiga)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3 a 4 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional de Chiang Mai (CNX)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Old City (pr\u00f3ximo aos templos hist\u00f3ricos)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nimmanhaemin (moderno, com caf\u00e9s e lojas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Riverside (tranquilo, perto do rio Ping)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116015\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116015\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116015\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refugio-cultural-de-montanhas-templos-e-natureza.jpg\" alt=\"Ref\u00fagio cultural de montanhas templos e natureza\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refugio-cultural-de-montanhas-templos-e-natureza.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refugio-cultural-de-montanhas-templos-e-natureza-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refugio-cultural-de-montanhas-templos-e-natureza-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refugio-cultural-de-montanhas-templos-e-natureza-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116015\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Um ref\u00fagio cultural cercado por montanhas, templos antigos e natureza exuberante<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"5_Krabi_%E2%80%93_um_dos_arquipelagos_mais_encantadores_do_mundo\"><\/span>5. Krabi \u2013 um dos arquip\u00e9lagos mais encantadores do mundo<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/web-stories\/krabi-tailandia\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Krabi<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> impressiona com suas fal\u00e9sias de calc\u00e1rio, praias de areia branca e \u00e1guas cristalinas, sendo um destino perfeito para quem busca paisagens naturais deslumbrantes e tranquilidade.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Railay Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ao Nang Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phi Phi Islands<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hong Islands<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emerald Pool (Sa Morakot)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tiger Cave Temple (Wat Tham Sua \/ Templo da Caverna do Tigre)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3 a 4 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional de Krabi (KBV)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ao Nang (conveniente e tur\u00edstico)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Railay Beach (mais exclusivo e tranquilo)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Krabi Town (mais econ\u00f4mico e local)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116016\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116016\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116016\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-1.jpg\" alt=\"Paisagens de fal\u00e9sias e ilhas tropicais deslumbrantes\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-1.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-1-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-1-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Paisagens-de-falesias-e-ilhas-tropicais-deslumbrantes-1-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116016\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Paisagens de tirar o f\u00f4lego com fal\u00e9sias calc\u00e1rias e ilhas tropicais deslumbrantes<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"6_Chiang_Rai_%E2%80%93_famosa_por_seus_templos_deslumbrantes\"><\/span>6. Chiang Rai \u2013 famosa por seus templos deslumbrantes<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/chiang-rai-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chiang Rai<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e9 conhecida por seus templos \u00fanicos e artisticamente impressionantes, combinando arquitetura tradicional com designs contempor\u00e2neos, al\u00e9m de oferecer paisagens montanhosas tranquilas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">White Temple (<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/web-stories\/templo-branco-wat-rong-khun\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Rong Khun<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \/ Templo Branco)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blue Temple (<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/wat-rong-suea-ten\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Rong Suea Ten<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \/ Templo Azul)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Black House (Baan Dam Museum \/ Casa Preta) <\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Golden Triangle (Tri\u00e2ngulo de Ouro)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/singha-park-chiang-rai\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Singha Park<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (Parque Singha)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/web-stories\/wat-huay-pla-kang\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Huay Pla Kang<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 3 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional de Chiang Rai (CEI)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centro da cidade (conveniente para explorar)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pr\u00f3ximo ao rio Kok (mais tranquilo e com belas vistas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c1reas rurais (para experi\u00eancias mais aut\u00eanticas e relaxantes)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116017\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116017\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116017\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Arquitetura-unica-de-templos-impressionantes.jpg\" alt=\"Arquitetura \u00fanica de templos impressionantes\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Arquitetura-unica-de-templos-impressionantes.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Arquitetura-unica-de-templos-impressionantes-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Arquitetura-unica-de-templos-impressionantes-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Arquitetura-unica-de-templos-impressionantes-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116017\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Arquitetura \u00fanica e templos impressionantes que parecem verdadeiras obras de arte<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"7_Hua_Hin_%E2%80%93_uma_cidade_litoranea_promissora\"><\/span>7. Hua Hin \u2013 uma cidade litor\u00e2nea promissora<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hua Hin \u00e9 um destino costeiro elegante e tranquilo, muito apreciado pela fam\u00edlia real tailandesa, combinando praias relaxantes, resorts sofisticados e uma atmosfera mais calma em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com outras cidades tur\u00edsticas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hua Hin Beach<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hua Hin Night Market (Mercado Noturno de Hua Hin)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cicada Market (Mercado de Cicada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maruekhathaiyawan Palace<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khao Takiab (Monkey Mountain \/ Montanha dos Macacos)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vana Nava Water Jungle<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 3 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto de Hua Hin (HHQ)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Suvarnabhumi (BKK) \u2013 cerca de 3 horas de viagem<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centro de Hua Hin (conveniente e animado)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Regi\u00e3o \u00e0 beira-mar (resorts e hot\u00e9is de luxo)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khao Takiab (mais tranquilo e com belas paisagens)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116018\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116018\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116018\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-tranquilo-a-beira-mar-para-relaxar.jpg\" alt=\"Destino tranquilo \u00e0 beira-mar para relaxar\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-tranquilo-a-beira-mar-para-relaxar.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-tranquilo-a-beira-mar-para-relaxar-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-tranquilo-a-beira-mar-para-relaxar-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Destino-tranquilo-a-beira-mar-para-relaxar-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116018\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Um destino tranquilo \u00e0 beira-mar, perfeito para relaxar longe do agito<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"8_Ayutthaya_%E2%80%93_cidade_historica_da_Tailandia\"><\/span>8. Ayutthaya \u2013 cidade hist\u00f3rica da Tail\u00e2ndia<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/ayutthaya-viagens\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ayutthaya<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e9 um destino fascinante para quem ama hist\u00f3ria, com ru\u00ednas antigas, templos impressionantes e um ambiente que reflete a antiga gl\u00f3ria do Reino do Si\u00e3o.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Mahathat (cabe\u00e7a de Buda entre ra\u00edzes de \u00e1rvore)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Phra Si Sanphet<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Chaiwatthanaram<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Yai Chai Mongkhon<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ayutthaya Historical Park (Parque Hist\u00f3rico de Ayutthaya)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cruzeiro pelo rio Chao Phraya<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 a 2 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional Suvarnabhumi (BKK) \u2013 cerca de 1 a 1,5 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centro hist\u00f3rico (pr\u00f3ximo \u00e0s ru\u00ednas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c0 beira do rio (ambiente tranquilo e paisagens bonitas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pr\u00f3ximo \u00e0 esta\u00e7\u00e3o de trem (conveniente para transporte)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116019\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116019\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116019\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Ruinas-e-templos-historicos-do-antigo-reino.jpg\" alt=\"Ru\u00ednas e templos hist\u00f3ricos do antigo reino\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Ruinas-e-templos-historicos-do-antigo-reino.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Ruinas-e-templos-historicos-do-antigo-reino-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Ruinas-e-templos-historicos-do-antigo-reino-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Ruinas-e-templos-historicos-do-antigo-reino-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116019\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ru\u00ednas antigas e templos hist\u00f3ricos que contam a rica hist\u00f3ria do antigo reino<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"9_Nakhon_Ratchasima_%E2%80%93_cidade_turistica_do_centro_da_Tailandia\"><\/span>9. Nakhon Ratchasima \u2013 cidade tur\u00edstica do centro da Tail\u00e2ndia<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nakhon Ratchasima, tamb\u00e9m conhecida como Korat, \u00e9 a porta de entrada para a regi\u00e3o nordeste da Tail\u00e2ndia, oferecendo uma mistura de cultura local, hist\u00f3ria e parques naturais impressionantes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phimai Historical Park (Parque Hist\u00f3rico de Phimai)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khao Yai National Park (Parque Hist\u00f3rico de Khao Yai)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thao Suranari Monument (Monumento Thao Suranari)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wat Sala Loi<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Korat Zoo (Zool\u00f3gico Korat)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Terminal 21 Korat<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 3 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto de Nakhon Ratchasima (NAK)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Suvarnabhumi (BKK) \u2013 cerca de 3 a 4 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centro da cidade (conveniente para explorar)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pr\u00f3ximo ao Khao Yai National Park (ideal para natureza)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c1reas pr\u00f3ximas a centros comerciais (mais modernas e confort\u00e1veis)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116020\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116020\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116020\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Porta-de-entrada-para-cultura-e-paisagens-naturais.jpg\" alt=\"Porta de entrada para cultura e paisagens naturais\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Porta-de-entrada-para-cultura-e-paisagens-naturais.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Porta-de-entrada-para-cultura-e-paisagens-naturais-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Porta-de-entrada-para-cultura-e-paisagens-naturais-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Porta-de-entrada-para-cultura-e-paisagens-naturais-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116020\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Uma porta de entrada para a cultura local e para paisagens naturais impressionantes<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"10_Kanchanaburi_%E2%80%93_cidade_de_ecoturismo_na_Tailandia\"><\/span>10. Kanchanaburi \u2013 cidade de ecoturismo na Tail\u00e2ndia<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"><\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kanchanaburi \u00e9 um destino perfeito para quem ama natureza e hist\u00f3ria, com paisagens verdes, cachoeiras deslumbrantes e locais hist\u00f3ricos ligados \u00e0 Segunda Guerra Mundial.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Atra\u00e7\u00f5es tur\u00edsticas:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Erawan National Park (Cachoeiras Erawan)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bridge over the River Kwai (Ponte sobre o Rio Kwai)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Death Railway (Ferrovia da Morte)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Memorial do Hellfire Pass<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sai Yok National Park (Parque Nacional Sai Yok)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">ElephantsWorld<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Tempo de perman\u00eancia<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 a 3 dias<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Aeroporto mais pr\u00f3ximo<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aeroporto Internacional Suvarnabhumi (BKK) \u2013 cerca de 2 a 3 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Onde se hospedar<\/b><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c0 beira do rio Kwai (resorts tranquilos e paisagens bonitas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centro da cidade (conveniente para transporte e passeios)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pr\u00f3ximo aos parques nacionais (ideal para contato com a natureza) <\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_116021\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-116021\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-116021\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Natureza-cachoeiras-e-historia-em-um-lugar.jpg\" alt=\"Natureza cachoeiras e hist\u00f3ria em um lugar\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Natureza-cachoeiras-e-historia-em-um-lugar.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Natureza-cachoeiras-e-historia-em-um-lugar-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Natureza-cachoeiras-e-historia-em-um-lugar-768x480.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Natureza-cachoeiras-e-historia-em-um-lugar-150x94.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-116021\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Natureza exuberante, cachoeiras incr\u00edveis e hist\u00f3ria marcante em um s\u00f3 lugar<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Antes de definir seu roteiro, \u00e9 importante entender qual \u00e9 a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/melhor-epoca-para-ir-para-tailandia\/\">Tail\u00e2ndia melhor epoca<\/a> para viajar, j\u00e1 que o clima pode influenciar bastante sua experi\u00eancia em cada destino. Se voc\u00ea ainda tem d\u00favidas sobre quando ir, confira nosso guia completo sobre a melhor \u00e9poca para visitar a Tail\u00e2ndia e planeje sua viagem com mais seguran\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Em resumo, <\/span><\/i><b><i>as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia<\/i><\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> oferecem experi\u00eancias diversas para todos os tipos de viajantes, desde praias paradis\u00edacas at\u00e9 centros hist\u00f3ricos cheios de cultura. Ao visitar as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 a oportunidade de mergulhar em tradi\u00e7\u00f5es \u00fanicas, saborear uma gastronomia incr\u00edvel e vivenciar momentos inesquec\u00edveis ao longo da sua jornada.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A Tail\u00e2ndia \u00e9 um dos destinos mais fascinantes do Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico, conhecida por sua cultura rica, templos deslumbrantes e paisagens naturais incr\u00edveis. Explorar as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia permite descobrir desde metr\u00f3poles vibrantes at\u00e9 destinos tranquilos cercados pela natureza. Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 planejando sua viagem, conhecer as cidades da Tail\u00e2ndia mais famosas vai ajudar a criar [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":116012,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[12453],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-116011","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tailandia"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/116011","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=116011"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/116011\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":117200,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/116011\/revisions\/117200"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/116012"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=116011"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=116011"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=116011"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}